[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21365.51, "timestamp": "05:56:05", "text": "多東西要看了。 喔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21368.15, "timestamp": "05:56:08", "text": "不。搞笑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21372.948, "timestamp": "05:56:12", "text": "喔天哪。 好吧。我想這是工作的一部分。那邊安靜。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21401.19, "timestamp": "05:56:41", "text": "？你們所有人同時出現。我不加班。來吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21405.07, "timestamp": "05:56:45", "text": "。來吧。哦，天哪。效率至上。明白了。"}]